] village, there is one survivor that they miss. Cloaked in mud and hiding by the bank of a small stream, the young man is there for two days before being able to move without being caught by your patrols. Now there are reports that the young hero is travelling around [tribe] lands, raising an army in retaliation for destroying their home. Prepare for a fight.","timing":{"minTurns":30,"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Cleared","weight":1},{"author":"Andy Auseon","id":"EVENTSTORY_TRIBE_RIVALS","name":"Tribal Rivals","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"base":160,"per":40,"text":"+160 Money (+40/city)","yield":"money"},{"base":50,"per":15,"text":"+50 Food (+15/city)","yield":"food"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYTRIBE_DENIED_SPOILS"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_0_BARBARIAN_1","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aeBonuses: BONUS_MONEY_GAIN_AVERAGE, BONUS_FOOD_GAIN_AVERAGE"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Curse the other tribes, this conquest is ours."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":20,"per":5,"text":"+20 Food (+5/city)","yield":"food"},{"base":80,"per":20,"text":"+80 Money (+20/city)","yield":"money"},{"text":"Opinion memory"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aeBonuses: BONUS_FOOD_GAIN_TINY, BONUS_MONEY_GAIN_TINY"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_1","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["Memory MEMORYTRIBE_SHARED_SPOILS"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_1_BARBARIAN_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Let them pillage and have their share."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"},{"text":"+4 Legitimacy"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYTRIBE_SALTED_FIELDS"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_2_BARBARIAN_0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iLegitimacy 4"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_TRIBE_RIVALS_OPTION_2","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Burn the spoils and salt the fields."}],"subjects":["Tribe","Tile","Tribe","Player Us"],"text":"The [tribe] camp has been razed! However, a trusted advisor reveals that the [tribe] lorded over their rivals, the [tribe], for many generations, and that the tribe's location and resources are highly prized. He is concerned that other barbarian groups will challenge our claim to the conquered site.","timing":{"repeat":"Every 60 turns"},"trigger":"Tribe Cleared","weight":6},{"author":"Soren Johnson","id":"EVENTSTORY_TUTORIAL_TRIBE_CAMP_CLEARED","name":"Tutorial: Tribe Site Cleared","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":100,"per":35,"text":"+100 Food (+35/city)","yield":"food"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_FOOD=100","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_FOOD=35"],"id":"BONUS_FOOD_GAIN_HUGE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"I'll make good use of this food!"}],"subjects":["Tile","Player Us"],"text":"You've driven the local [tribe] away from this City Site! You can now claim this Site by placing a Unit on it. This will prevent the return of the [tribe] and will also keep other nations from founding a City here. The locals have left a large cache of Food behind. You can use this to begin building a new Settler to claim this location!","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Tribe Cleared","weight":1},{"author":"Andy Auseon","conditions":["Disappointed With Leader"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_RELATIONSHIP_URGING_CAUTION","name":"Urging Caution","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"-1 Courage"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["RemoveLeaderRelationship RELATIONSHIP_DISAPPOINTED_WITH"],"id":"BONUS_LEADER_DISAPPOINTED_WITH_REMOVE","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_COURAGE=-1"],"id":"BONUS_LOSE_COURAGE_1","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["DiplomacyTribe DIPLOMACY_TRUCE"],"id":"BONUS_EVENTOPTION_RELATIONSHIP_URGING_CAUTION_OPTION_0_BARBARIAN","pct":null,"weig